#. ja: モルボルホルン
#. de: Morbol-Horn
#. fr: cor morbol
#. column 2: morbol horns
#. column 8: This horn of bone emits a deep tone (and a retch-inducing odor) that will bring your morbol undulating to your side.
#. column 9: Morbol Horn
msgctxt "Item:28116:0:0"
msgid "morbol horn"
msgstr "рог морбола"

#. de: Morbol-Hörner
#. fr: cors morbol
#. column 0: morbol horn
#. column 8: This horn of bone emits a deep tone (and a retch-inducing odor) that will bring your morbol undulating to your side.
#. column 9: Morbol Horn
msgctxt "Item:28116:0:2"
msgid "morbol horns"
msgstr "рога морбола"

#. ja: マウント修得<br>モルボルを呼び寄せるための不気味な角笛
#. de: Das giftgrüne Horn scheint aus einem uralten Holz geschnitzt und stößt einen unangenehmen Ton aus. Ruft einen übellaunigen Morbol herbei.
#. fr: [Monture]<br>Ce cor inquiétant vous permet d'appeler un morbol.
#. column 0: morbol horn
#. column 2: morbol horns
#. column 9: Morbol Horn
msgctxt "Item:28116:0:8"
msgid "This horn of bone emits a deep tone (and a retch-inducing odor) that will bring your morbol undulating to your side."
msgstr "Этот костяной рог издаёт низкий гул и источает тошнотворный запах. Услышав его, ваш морбол извиваясь примчится к вам."

#. ja: モルボルホルン
