#. fr: Cor morbol
#. column 0: morbol horn
#. column 2: morbol horns
#. column 8: This horn of bone emits a deep tone (and a retch-inducing odor) that will bring your morbol undulating to your side.
msgctxt "Item:28116:0:9"
msgid "Morbol Horn"
msgstr "Рог морбола"

#. ja: ファットポークシーホルン
#. de: Quiexie-Horn
#. fr: cor porxie potelé
#. column 2: portly porxie horns
#. column 8: Wrought of clay, this horn emits a mellow sound and the aroma of cured meats to lure your portly porxie to your side.
#. column 9: Portly Porxie Horn
msgctxt "Item:28117:0:0"
msgid "portly porxie horn"
msgstr "рог упитанного поркси"

#. de: Quiexie-Hörner
#. fr: cors porxie potelé
#. column 0: portly porxie horn
