#. de: kholusisch[a] Spezialität
#. fr: sac de spécialités de Kholusia
#. column 2: packages of Kholusian miscellany
#. column 8: While not everything included in this assortment of locally sourced materials could be considered valuable, the various items combine to convey the very essence of Kholusia. This could, however, be attributed to the pungent oceanic odor they all seem to share.
#. column 9: Kholusian Miscellany
msgctxt "Item:28203:0:0"
