#. ja: スターライト・ホワイトツリーEX
#. de: exklusiv[a] schneeweiß[a] Sternenlichtbäumchen
#. fr: sapin blanc de la fête des étoiles spécial
#. column 2: authentic silver Starlight sentinels
#. column 8: A potted conifer displayed in homes during the Starlight Celebration. Its snowy color will make your décor sumptuous─and your gatherings lively as you argue with friends and neighbors over whether it is superior to the more traditional green. It is not known how long ago it was placed in its ceramic prison, and some attribute its unnatural longevity to it having formed a blood pact with a voidsent, which may be unlikely considering its distinct lack of blood.
#. column 9: Authentic Silver Starlight Sentinel
msgctxt "Item:28911:0:0"
msgid "authentic silver Starlight sentinel"
msgstr "настоящая серебряная ёлка звёздного света"

#. de: exklusiv[a] schneeweiß[a] Sternenlichtbäumchen
#. fr: sapins blancs de la fête des étoiles spéciaux
#. column 0: authentic silver Starlight sentinel
#. column 8: A potted conifer displayed in homes during the Starlight Celebration. Its snowy color will make your décor sumptuous─and your gatherings lively as you argue with friends and neighbors over whether it is superior to the more traditional green. It is not known how long ago it was placed in its ceramic prison, and some attribute its unnatural longevity to it having formed a blood pact with a voidsent, which may be unlikely considering its distinct lack of blood.
#. column 9: Authentic Silver Starlight Sentinel
msgctxt "Item:28911:0:2"
msgid "authentic silver Starlight sentinels"
msgstr "подлинные серебристые ёлки Звёздного Праздника"

#. ja: 真っ白な星芒祭用の室内向け植木鉢
#. de: Ein eingetopfter Nadelbaum mit schneeweißen Nadeln für die Sternenlichtfest-Dekoration.
#. fr: Un sapin d'intérieur à épines blanches, tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>lement utilisé pour décorer les habitations à l'occasion de la fête des étoiles.
#. column 0: authentic silver Starlight sentinel
#. column 2: authentic silver Starlight sentinels
#. column 9: Authentic Silver Starlight Sentinel
msgctxt "Item:28911:0:8"
msgid "A potted conifer displayed in homes during the Starlight Celebration. Its snowy color will make your décor sumptuous─and your gatherings lively as you argue with friends and neighbors over whether it is superior to the more traditional green. It is not known how long ago it was placed in its ceramic prison, and some attribute its unnatural longevity to it having formed a blood pact with a voidsent, which may be unlikely considering its distinct lack of blood."
msgstr "Хвойное дерево в горшке, которым украшают дома на Звёздный Праздник. Снежная белизна придаст убранству роскошный вид, а заодно оживит посиделки: друзья и соседи непременно начнут спорить, лучше ли оно традиционной зелёной ёлки. Неизвестно, сколько времени оно провело в своём керамическом плену. Некоторые считают, что оно живёт так долго благодаря кровавому договору с демоном из Бездны, но это маловероятно: крови у дерева явно нет."

#. ja: スターライト・ホワイトツリーEX
