#. ja: 復興用のトード
#. de: Himmelsstadt-Kröte
#. fr: crapaud de restauration
#. column 2: skybuilders' toads
#. column 8: What is worse than being born a toad? Being born a toad and then carried against your wishes from your home in western Thanalan to icy Ishgard, where if you don't freeze to death, are likely to be chopped up and boiled in a pot. That is what is worse. Much worse, in fact.
#. column 9: Skybuilders' Toad
msgctxt "Item:28916:0:0"
msgid "skybuilders' toad"
msgstr "жаба для строителей небесного города"

