#. column 0: Galadion goby
#. column 8: Amateur anglers are advised to familiarize themselves with the difference between the Merlthor and Galadion gobies as early as possible, as devotees of both varieties tend to become rather heated when one is (understandably) mistaken for the other.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]
#. column 9: Galadion Goby
msgctxt "Item:28937:0:2"
msgid "Galadion gobies"
msgstr "галадионские бычки"

#. ja: ガラディオン湾沖合に棲息するハゼの一種<br>[魚拓額縁G1に設定可能]
#. de: Diese Grundel-Art lebt in den tiefen Gewässern der Galadion-Bucht. (Kann als Fischdruck in Rahmen der Größe S ausgestellt werden.)
#. fr: Un gobie vivant dans la baie de Galadion.<br>[Affichable dans un cadre à ichtyogramme de petite taille]
#. column 0: Galadion goby
#. column 2: Galadion gobies
#. column 9: Galadion Goby
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:28937:0:8"
msgid "Amateur anglers are advised to familiarize themselves with the difference between the Merlthor and Galadion gobies as early as possible, as devotees of both varieties tend to become rather heated when one is (understandably) mistaken for the other.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on small canvases.]"
msgstr "Начинающим рыбакам стоит как можно раньше научиться отличать мерлторских бычков от галадионских. Поклонники этих разновидностей легко вспыхивают, если их (пусть и вполне понятно) перепутать.<br><br>[Подходит для маленьких холстов.]"

